OL,3,APolanski selected as Green Party
OL,4,Acandidate for Starmer's former seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski has
OL,7,Fbeen selected as the party's candidate
OL,8,Fin the by-election for Sir Keir
OL,9,FStarmer's former seat in Parliament.
OL,11,FPolanski, who is a London Assembly
OL,12,Fmember, will stand in Holborn and St
OL,13,FPancras on 8 October as he seeks to
OL,14,Fbecome an MP.
OL,16,FHe was voted to be the party's
OL,17,Fcandidate by members of the Camden
OL,18,FGreen Party ahead of local councillor
OL,19,FHamza Chowdhury.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
